    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chibi Tactics&quot; is a turn-based tactical game. You will control adorable chibi characters to fight on terrain with varying elevations. Come on! Join the girls in overcoming numerous challenges to uncover dark conspiracies and save this world on the brink of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/bb7b519ad80bbbd6121c802997c1f5c7.poster.avif?t=1750949268\" width=307 height=363 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/bb7b519ad80bbbd6121c802997c1f5c7.webm?t=1750949268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of character units, such as knights, archers, martial artists, ninjas, etc., each have their own unique talents and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of equipment brings not just simple changes in numerical values, but can also bring changes in gameplay. Explore the possibilities of combinations between different equipment and characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various difficulties to cater to different players. Both casual players who find it boring and challenge-seeking players can fully enjoy the fun of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story, meet different characters in adventures, and find the truth on the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/647a2ead9ca20b01d5297d1ff9fc4bad.poster.avif?t=1750949268\" width=276 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/647a2ead9ca20b01d5297d1ff9fc4bad.webm?t=1750949268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Chibi Tactics&quot; is a turn-based tactical game. You will control adorable chibi characters to fight on terrain with varying elevations. Come on! Join the girls in overcoming numerous challenges to uncover dark conspiracies and save this world on the brink of destruction!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/bb7b519ad80bbbd6121c802997c1f5c7.poster.avif?t=1750949268\" width=307 height=363 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/bb7b519ad80bbbd6121c802997c1f5c7.webm?t=1750949268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various types of character units, such as knights, archers, martial artists, ninjas, etc., each have their own unique talents and skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of equipment brings not just simple changes in numerical values, but can also bring changes in gameplay. Explore the possibilities of combinations between different equipment and characters!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various difficulties to cater to different players. Both casual players who find it boring and challenge-seeking players can fully enjoy the fun of the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging story, meet different characters in adventures, and find the truth on the battlefield!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2857780/extras/647a2ead9ca20b01d5297d1ff9fc4bad.poster.avif?t=1750949268\" width=276 height=343 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea